<section id="about" class="px-6 py-24">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl">
    <h2 class="mb-2 font-mono text-sm text-accent">About</h2>
    <h3 class="mb-12 text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">A bit about me</h3>

    <div class="grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-5">
      <div class="space-y-5 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed md:col-span-3">
        <p>
          I'm a senior software engineer and technical lead based in <strong class="text-zinc-200">Indonesia</strong> with
          over 10 years of experience shipping production systems. I graduated with an Associate degree
          in Information Processing from <strong class="text-zinc-200">Seifu Institute of Technology, Osaka</strong>.
        </p>
        <p>
          I architect and deliver products end-to-end &mdash;
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">APIs</strong>,
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">web</strong>,
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">mobile</strong>, and
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">infrastructure</strong>.
          I lead small focused teams, set architecture standards, and still write the hard path myself.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently Technical Lead at <strong class="text-zinc-200">PT Lamacca Kreatif Solusi</strong>,
          I've shipped 30+ systems for government, enterprise, healthcare, and agribusiness
          clients in Indonesia and Japan. I work in
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">Indonesian</strong>,
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">English</strong>, and
          <strong class="text-zinc-200">Japanese</strong>.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 md:col-span-2">
        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 p-5">
          <div class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Quick facts</div>
          <dl class="space-y-3">
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Location</dt>
              <dd class="text-sm text-zinc-200">Jakarta, Indonesia</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Education</dt>
              <dd class="text-sm text-zinc-200">Seifu Institute of Technology, Osaka</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Experience</dt>
              <dd class="text-sm text-zinc-200">10+ years</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Projects shipped</dt>
              <dd class="text-sm text-zinc-200">30+</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Users impacted</dt>
              <dd class="text-sm text-zinc-200">1.6M+</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>

        <div class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/50 p-5">
          <div class="mb-4 font-mono text-xs text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wider">Languages</div>
          <dl class="space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-zinc-200">Indonesian</dt>
              <dd class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Native</dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-zinc-200">English</dt>
              <dd class="text-xs text-zinc-500">
                C2 ·
                <a
                  href="https://cert.efset.org/tejxUr"
                  target="_blank"
                  rel="noopener noreferrer"
                  class="text-accent/80 transition hover:text-accent"
                >
                  EF SET
                </a>
              </dd>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4">
              <dt class="text-sm text-zinc-200">Japanese</dt>
              <dd class="text-xs text-zinc-500">JLPT N1</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </div>
      </div>
